# X Marks the Spot (otherAreas 65): Tavnazian Safehold's Despachiaire (default 106), Parelbriaux (default 294; the second
# of the name, 16883762, is cutscene_only: not talkable) and Odeya (default 150), no scripts; Phomiuna Aqueducts' _0r9 (a script with no handlers; default
# DOOR_FIRMLY_SHUT). CoP Ancient Vows current: CoP 2-2's completed section answers Despachiaire 106 (replaceDefault).
# Despachiaire 144 (Progress), finished: begun. Accepted: 144 (Event, importantOnce), finished: nothing; again: the 144 is
# down to Default: CoP 2-2's 106. Odeya at Prog 0: nil, 150. Parelbriaux 145, finished: Prog 1; again at Prog 1: 145.
# Odeya 141 (0, the liver), finished: Prog 2. Parelbriaux at Prog 2: nil, 294. Odeya 146 (0, the
# liver); the liver traded: 142, finished: taken, Prog 3. Odeya 147. Phomiuna: _0r9 37, finished: Prog 4; again: nil, its
# default. Back (a zone change: the importantOnce is reset): Despachiaire 144. Odeya 143, finished: completed (4000 gil),
# Post 1. Completed: Odeya 148, finished: Post 2; again: 148. Leaving the zone at Post 2: quest:cleanup (Post 0). Back:
# Odeya: nil, 150.
lists TavnazianSafehold/Despachiaire/onTrigger TavnazianSafehold/Parelbriaux/onTrigger TavnazianSafehold/Odeya/onTrigger TavnazianSafehold/Odeya/onTrade TavnazianSafehold/onEventFinish/141 TavnazianSafehold/onEventFinish/142 TavnazianSafehold/onEventFinish/143 TavnazianSafehold/onEventFinish/144 TavnazianSafehold/onEventFinish/145 TavnazianSafehold/onEventFinish/148 PhomiunaAqueducts/_0r9/onTrigger PhomiunaAqueducts/onEventFinish/37
lists TavnazianSafehold/onZoneOut/1
char zone=TavnazianSafehold pos=112.7,-40,-85.5 job=WAR lvl=75
mission Cop AncientVows current
item TavnazianLiver
login
